# The DECK of a built Walkway piece: the scaffold (legs, rails, ledgers) and the planks. The game puts it on the
# Walkway's own origin (StructureSystem::updateWalkway), which is 0.1 over the deck top. The collider is the deck
# alone (0.5 m thick, its top at -0.1): players and units stand on it, and nothing fits under it.
Prefab gameWalkwayDeck
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer walkway
		Node WalkwayDeck
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.5 0.36 0.2
	Component Physics
		Body Static
		Shape Box
		HalfExtents 1 0.25 1
		Offset 0 -0.35 0
